            </svg>
            <span>WhatsApp Clinic</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-japandi-sand/50 border border-japandi-clay/40 shadow-sm space-y-6">
          <h2 class="text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-japandi-moss tracking-widest">Benefits of Dental Bridges</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-xs font-light text-japandi-earth">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-japandi-moss/20 text-japandi-moss flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">&check;</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Completely Non-Surgical:</strong> Restores missing teeth without bone grafting or oral surgery.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-japandi-moss/20 text-japandi-moss flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">&check;</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Prevents Tooth Migration:</strong> Keeps neighboring teeth from drifting or tipping into empty spaces.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-japandi-moss/20 text-japandi-moss flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">&check;</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Fast Turnaround Time:</strong> Full bridge completion typically achieved in just two clinical visits.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-japandi-moss/20 text-japandi-moss flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">&check;</span>
